schway-screen 1
screen shell-long-failure-expanded
title Long command, expanded output
description The same nonzero command retains its outcome while its original bounded output is expanded.
variant light-80
size 80x30
cursor 7 27 visible
== text
 ⚡ schway  /project

   !  BASH   printf '%s\n' 'ตรวจผลลัพธ์ภาษาไทย 🧪 café ตรวจผลลัพธ์ภา… Exit 1 ▾
     Exit code: 1
     ตรวจผลลัพธ์ภาษาไทย 🧪
     The command returned a nonzero exit.



















